# World Map Open Source — Core

## Product boundary

- Reuse **OpenFreeMap** tiles + **MapLibre**. Never invent a tile farm or copy OSM dumps into this repo.
- Differentiation = **git-native GeoJSON overlays** + thin SDK + agent/human PRs.
- Full plan: `docs/PLAN.md`.

## Local vs repo

| Commit to GitHub | Keep local / ignore |
|------------------|---------------------|
| `overlays/`, `schemas/`, `apps/`, `packages/`, docs, CI | Personal agent stores, secrets, `.env` |
| `.cursor/rules/`, `.cursor/skills/` (shared) | Private Cursor memories |

## Agent contribution rules

- Add map data only under `overlays/<category>/` as FeatureCollections.
- MVP categories: `places`, `nature`, `transport`, `culture`, `community`.
- Every feature needs stable `properties.id`, `category`, `kind`, `source`, `license`.
- No PII. No silent force-push. Do not commit unless the user asks.
- For `community` (and later `hazards`): draft only; flag for human review.
